d 'FCUSUM': module to perform the Fourier CUSUM test for the null of cointegration
d
d  fcusum tests the null hypothesis of cointegration against the
d alternative of no cointegration, allowing for smooth structural
d change in the intercept approximated by a Fourier pair at a
d fractional or integer frequency. The cointegrating regression is
d estimated by dynamic OLS, the residual CUSUM statistic of Xiao
d and Phillips (2002) is scaled by a Bartlett long-run variance, a
d sup-F pre-test decides whether the Fourier terms are needed, and
d bootstrap critical values replicate the frequency search. It is
d the Stata version of my R package FCUSUM 1.1.0 on CRAN. 
d
d KW: cointegration
d KW: CUSUM
d KW: Fourier
d KW: structural break
d KW: dynamic OLS
d KW: time series
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
d
d Author: Taha Zaghdoudi,  University of Jendouba
d Support: email zedtaha@@gmail.com
d
f fcusum.ado
f fcusum.sthlp
